    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Uncanny Gateway</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Destruction Sphere (energy bomb)</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> The splash damage radius of your energy bomb increases by 5 feet, plus an additional 5 feet per 5 caster levels. In addition, if you instill an energy bomb as a standard or full-round action, you may throw it as part of the same action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/destruction#toc130\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
